        "density": 0.02639,
        "chars": 446,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 26.5
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        298,
        2422,
        2007,
        2717
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "By parity of reasoning, my predecessors have ruled that a City department head may properly deliver a series of lectures at a university in the City while holding office; a two-hour lecture one morning a week; a course requiring three hours per week in the evening; membership on the Executive Committee of the New York World's Fair 1964 Corporation.",
